      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "tiny avatars too.  Then again, if there are tags for a model, what's to stop someone from just not having that tag?\n\nI'm all for combat, and varied size, but the game has to be able to work with various sizes too.  \n\nExample:  tiny avatars having less health, big avatars are easier to hit, but have more HP to compensate.   so I would like there to also be coding features, should Tags actually become a thing, be able to use those tags for additional features.",
      "viewerReactions": null
