  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-14T07:14:14.962Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes people abuse hand puppets in Battles to gain an advantage by having a \"mysterious\" hitbox.\n\nSo models should really have the option for a \"HandPuppet\" tag that worlds can optionally block. And if seen with an Untagged hand puppet can be reported. Also if you see someone who has a questionable model you should be able to view their selected Tags to report them if the appropriate ones are un-applied. (i will be making that last bit a separate post to make sure its recognized)",
